  "question": "Background / Context\n\nThe project involves creating a plugin bundle for Django CMS that integrates Bootstrap 4 components. Django CMS Bootstrap 4 Plugin Bundle enables developers to incorporate a variety of Bootstrap 4 components into their Django CMS projects. Bootstrap is a popular front-end framework that provides pre-designed UI components for building responsive web pages.\n\nObjectives\n\nThe primary objective is to provide a set of reusable Bootstrap 4 components that can be easily integrated into Django CMS installations without directly modifying frontend styles or JavaScript.\n\nStakeholders & Users\n\n- Developers: Implement and customize the plugin in their Django CMS projects.\n- CMS Administrators: Utilize the components for creating content without requiring deep technical knowledge.\n\nFunctional Descriptions\n\n1. Component Integration:\n   - Integrate standard Bootstrap 4 components such as Alerts, Badge, Card, Carousel, Collapse, Grid, Jumbotron, Link, List Group, Media, Picture, Tabs, and Utilities.\n\n2. Database Tables:\n   - Maintain component-specific tables each with attributes and foreign keys to manage relations and content efficiently.\n\n3. Alerts:\n   - Configure alerts with context, dismissibility, and tag types.\n\n4. Badge and Card:\n   - Customize badge appearances and card layouts with different contexts and attributes.\n\n5. Carousel:\n   - Manage images and slides within a carousel setup, including controls for interval, indicators, and transitions.\n\n6. Collapse Content:\n   - Manage collapsible content for blockquotes, codes, and figures.\n\n7. Grid Systems:\n   - Utilize Bootstrap’s grid system to define responsive container, row, and column arrangements.\n\n8. Jumbotron:\n   - Configure jumbotron settings with fluid options and attributes.\n\n9. Media and Utilities:\n   - Facilitate media embedding and spacing utilities for layout adjustments.\n\nNon-Functional Descriptions\n\n- Scalability:\n  - Ensure compatibility with existing Django CMS installations and scalability for large content sets.\n  \n- Flexibility:\n  - Allow for the addition of new components without frontend dependencies. Styles and JavaScript must be added manually by the developers as per the project's requirements.\n\n- Usability:\n  - Ensure that CMS administrators can easily use the components through an intuitive interface.\n\n- Performance:\n  - The plugin should not negatively impact the performance of the Django CMS setup.\n\n- Maintainability:\n  - The plugin's codebase should be well-documented and maintainable for adapting to future updates of Django CMS or Bootstrap.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: schemabench_0033\nCREATE TABLE `alert` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `context` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `dismissible` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `tag_type` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `badge` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `context` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `pill` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `tag_type` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `card` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `context` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `header` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `footer` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `image_alt` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `image_position` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `tag_type` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `carousel` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `interval_ms` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `indicators` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `controls` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `fade` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `carousel_slide` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `carousel_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `position` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `image` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `caption` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `alt_text` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `active` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  KEY `carousel_slide_ibfk_1` (`carousel_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `carousel_slide_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`carousel_id`) REFERENCES `carousel` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `collapse` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `show` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `tag_type` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
